#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:1 
msgid "４２番"
msgstr "#42"

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:1 
msgid "地球の生命体にアンテナか。\nそれが遺言って言われてもな……。\n"
msgstr ""
"Use the antenna to stream\n"
"the people of Earth?\n"
"Even if that was his final request...\n"

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:2 
msgid "４２番、聞いた？\nこれ、視聴者参加型の番組なんだってさ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Hey #42, didja hear?\n"
"Apparently, this show is interactive.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:3 
msgid "４２番"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:3 
msgid "ああ、３代目に就任したおつきから聞いた。\n視聴者参加型というのは好都合だな。\n"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, I heard it from Otsuki #3.\n"
"I think this type of broadcasting\n"
"is appropriate.\n"

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:4 
msgid "……なんで？\n"
msgstr "...Why?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:5 
msgid "４２番"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:5 
msgid "いいか……姫は乱暴で容赦のないお方だが、\nあれで雰囲気に流されやすいところもある。\n"
msgstr ""
"Listen... The Princess is a rough and\n"
"unforgiving person, but she also tends\n"
"to get swept up in the moment.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:6 
msgid "４２番"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:6 
msgid "そして、これはテレビ番組。\nテレビといえば視聴率。\n"
msgstr ""
"Well, this is television program.\n"
"Y'know, when it comes to TV,\n"
"the ratings are important.\n"

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:7 
msgid "確かギャラクシ―テレビ弌弌ＦＳＵの視聴率は\nリアルタイム集計だったっけ？\n"
msgstr ""
"I think Galaxy TV's FSU ratings\n"
"are calculated in real-time, right?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:8 
msgid "４２番"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:8 
msgid "姫のお立場であれば、民衆弌弌つまり視聴者の\n客観的な数字も参考にされるはずだ。\n"
msgstr ""
"From her position, the opinions of\n"
"the common people, in other words,\n"
"the viewers, may influence her.\n"

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:9 
msgid "それって……視聴率が上がり続けさえすれば、\n俺たちも助かるってこと？\n"
msgstr ""
"Then that means....If the ratings go up,\n"
"we can be saved?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:10 
msgid "４２番"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:10 
msgid "そういうことだ。そして、サクラを使えば\n視聴率を操作することもできる！\n"
msgstr ""
"Exactly. And if we fake the ratings,\n"
"we can manipulate the viewership\n"
"figures as well!\n"

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:11 
msgid "そういうことか！\nさすが、分析と説明の４２番！\n"
msgstr ""
"That's great news!\n"
"Wonderful analysis and\n"
"explanation as always, #42!\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:12 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:12 
msgid "おまえら、こんな所にいたのか。\n番組制作のチ―ム編成、始まってるぞ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Oh, this is where you guys were.\n"
"We already started organizing a\n"
"program production team.\n"

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:13 
msgid "あ、おつきの３。そう言えば、\n番組のプロデュ―サ―って誰がやるの？\n"
msgstr ""
"Oh, Otsuki #3. Speaking of which,\n"
"who's going to be the show's producer?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:14 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:14 
msgid "心配ない、既に手配してある。\n今もこちらの様子を見ているはずだ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry, we already have one.\n"
"They're probably watching us right now.\n"

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:15 
msgid "そ……そうだったのか。\n誰だか知らないけど、よろしく〜！\n"
msgstr ""
"All right...I see.\n"
"I don't know who you are,\n"
"but let's do this!\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:16 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:16 
msgid "それじゃ、おまえたちは早く行け。\n"
msgstr ""
"Well then, you guys better hurry up\n"
"and get going.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:17 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:17 
msgid "編成終了後、各放送ごとに１チ―ム、\nそれぞれ１隻の中継船に乗り込んで出発だ！\n"
msgstr ""
"After the teams are organized,\n"
"one for each program will get\n"
"on a relay ship and take off!\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:18 
msgid "＆４２番"
msgstr "D1 & #42"

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:18 
msgid "了解っ！\n"
msgstr "Roger that!\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:19 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:19 
msgid "さて……今、我が置かれている立場は\nこれで理解してくれたかな？\n"
msgstr ""
"Anyway....do you understand the\n"
"situation we're in right now?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:20 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:20 
msgid "そうか、助かる。ではプロデュ―サ―である\n君の役目を説明しよう。\n"
msgstr ""
"I see, that's good.\n"
"Then let me explain your role\n"
"as producer.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:21 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:21 
msgid "そんな、ひどい……。\n"
msgstr "Uh oh, that's not good...\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:22 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:22 
msgid "これまでの説明で、我が置かれている立場は\n理解してくれたよな？\n"
msgstr ""
"You understand the position we're\n"
"in now, right?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:23 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:23 
msgid "君の役目は、姫を満足させるべく、今日１日\n合計８時間分の番組を放映することだ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Your job is to broadcast a total of\n"
"eight hours of programming today\n"
"to satisfy the Princess.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:24 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:24 
msgid "この番組は、地球人のおもしろおかしい生態を\nＫＨＵＤ中継するというバラエティ番組だ。\n"
msgstr ""
"This program is a variety show that\n"
"broadcasts live footage of the amusing\n"
"and quirky behavior of earthlings.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:25 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:25 
msgid "まずは、中継の対象となる地球人を\n選ぶ必要がある。\n"
msgstr ""
"First, you'll have to decide\n"
"which earthlings our show will follow.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:26 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:26 
msgid "君の手元には、このように地球の一都市である\n時定市が表示される。\n"
msgstr ""
"Before you lies Tokisadame City,\n"
"just one city among many on Earth.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:27 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:27 
msgid "方向キ―でカ―ソルを動かし、中継したい\n地球人のいる場所でボタンを押して決定だ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Use the directional keys to move the cursor,\n"
"then press the confirm button at the location\n"
"where the earthling you want to broadcast is.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:28 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:28 
msgid "すると、その場所のＫＨＵＤ映像が\n送られてくるぞ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Then the LIVE footage for that\n"
"location will be transmitted.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:29 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:29 
msgid "どの地球人を選ぶかは君に一任されるが、\nよく考えて決めてくれ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Which earthlings we'll follow is all\n"
"up to you, so choose carefully.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 3 
#: sc/0208:30 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 3 
#: sc/0208:30 
msgid "時定高校と呼ばれているエリアは、\nボタンを押すとその中に入ることもできる。\n"
msgstr ""
"You can also select and enter\n"
"Tokisadame High School.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 2 
#: sc/0208:31 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 2 
#: sc/0208:31 
msgid "時定高校の中でも、外と同じように\n方向キ―で場所を選ぶことができるぞ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Even within Tokisadame High School,\n"
"you can select locations using the\n"
"directional keys, just like outside.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 2 
#: sc/0208:32 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 2 
#: sc/0208:32 
msgid "……さて、次は\nスタ―ラ姫のつぶやきについてだ。\n"
msgstr ""
"...Now, the next thing is to\n"
"explain Princess Starla's mutterings.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:33 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:33 
msgid "姫様は番組をご覧になりながら、\n様なご意見をつぶやかれるだろう。\n"
msgstr ""
"As she watches, the Princess will\n"
"mutter what she thinks about your work.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:34 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:34 
msgid "姫は宇宙を統べるお方だ。当然、お一人でも\n番組の視聴率に及ぼす影響は大きい。\n"
msgstr ""
"The Princess rules all of outer space.\n"
"Naturally, she'll influence our ratings\n"
"quite a bit, just by herself.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:35 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:35 
msgid "姫のご要望にお応えすることができれば、\nかなりの視聴率アップが見込めるはずだ。\n"
msgstr ""
"If you follow her demands,\n"
"you can expect a strong ratings boost.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:36 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0208:36 
msgid "視聴率があがれば、\n我の安全も確保されるわけだが……。\n"
msgstr ""
"And as long as our ratings are high,\n"
"we can breathe easy...\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:37 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:37 
msgid "君にも、プロデュ―サ―として特定の地球人を\nプッシュしたいという欲求もあるだろう。\n"
msgstr ""
"As a producer, you must also have\n"
"a good eye for certain earthlings.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:38 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:38 
msgid "姫のつぶやきには、可能であれば\n応える程度で考えてみてくれ。\n"
msgstr ""
"If possible, please only respond\n"
"to the Princess's mutterings\n"
"when it's absolutely necessary.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:39 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:39 
msgid "では、地球の日本時間、\n０９：００より放映開始だ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Okay then, the broadcast begins\n"
"at 9:00 AM Japan Standard Time.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:40 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr "Otsuki #3"

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0208:40 
msgid "健闘を祈る！\n"
msgstr "Good luck!\n"
